  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-06T10:52:10+05:30\">June 6, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">10:52 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bsf.gov.in/\">Border Security Force (BSF)</a>,</strong> has released the <strong>Exam Date</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"256\">recruitment of Assistant Sub Inspector (ASI) Stenographer and Head Constable (HC) Ministerial 10+2 posts</strong>. The <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"282\">BSF exam </strong>will be conducted<strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"282\"> on September 2026</strong>. The last date to submit the application form was <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"421\">July 08, 2024</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"467\">Exam Date</strong> using their <strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"540\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the official portal (link provided below).</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">BSF ASI Stenographer and Head Constable Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bsf-hcm-asi-steno-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>09 June 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>08 July 2024</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>08</strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> July 2024</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : September 2026</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Available Soon</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>BSF</strong><b>&nbsp;</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General, OBC, EWS </strong>: <strong>₹ 147.25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> SC / ST, PWD</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 00/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">BSF ASI Stenographer and Head Constable Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 August 2024</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>25 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BSF</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>ASI Steno &amp; HC Ministerial&nbsp;</strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">1752 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">BSF ASI Steno &amp; HC Ministerial Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 54px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 20.9046%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.7643%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 59.331%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 20.9046%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">ASI Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.7643%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">256 Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 59.331%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong>passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam</strong> from any recognized board in India and possess <strong>stenography skills</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.9046%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">HC Ministerial</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.7643%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1496 Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 59.331%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong>passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam</strong> from any recognized board in India. For more details, refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong></span> <strong><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/niacl-assistants-online-form-2024/\">NIACL Assistants Online Form 2024</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Visit the <strong>official Border Security Force (BSF)</strong> recruitment website.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Go to the <strong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"172\">Latest Notifications</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"191\">Recruitment</strong>&nbsp;section.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Click on the <strong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"258\">“BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026”</strong>&nbsp;notice link.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;The official exam date notification PDF will open on the screen.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Check the exam date, shift timing, and important instructions carefully.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Download the Exam Date Notice PDF for future reference.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Take a printout of the notice if required.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Regularly check the official website for admit card updates.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;BSF ASI Steno &amp; HC Ministerial Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Written Exam</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Skill Test</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Physical Measurement Test</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Document Verification</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Medical Examination</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: ce